OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer saves drowning man in
OL,4,A'pure chance' rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer said it was "pure
OL,7,Fchance" he was in the right place at
OL,8,Fthe right time to save the life of a
OL,9,Fyoung man drowning in the sea.
OL,11,FPC Tom Windeatt from Essex Police had
OL,12,Fbeen dealing with an arrest opposite
OL,13,FJubilee Beach in Southend-on-Sea when a
OL,14,Fteenager told him a friend was in
OL,15,Ftrouble.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
