OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer saves drowning man in
OL,4,A'pure chance' rescue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe officer ran to the water and
OL,7,Fperformed CPR. "He was totally
OL,8,Funresponsive. I thought he was dead,
OL,9,Fhe's not coming back," he said. The man
OL,10,Fspent two days in intensive care after
OL,11,Fthe incident in July but was expected
OL,12,Fto make a full recovery.
OL,14,FCh Insp Jane Childs said: "PC
OL,15,FWindeatt's actions were exceptional. He
OL,16,Fshowed extraordinary professionalism,
OL,17,Fcourage and compassion in challenging
OL,18,Fcircumstances."
